    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5888" root="جعب" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِجْعَبٌ</span></b>  One <i>who often prostrates,</i> or <i>throws
down, others,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِرِّيعٌ</span>, [in some copies of the K,
erroneously, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَرِيع</span>,]) <i>but is not himself prostrated,</i>
or <i>thrown down.</i> (K, TA.)

